OL,3,GNEWSACricketers mistaken for migrants
OL,4,Ahad 'doors knocked on'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of protesters reached the hotel
OL,7,Ffloor where members of the Pakistan
OL,8,Funder-19 cricket team were staying
OL,9,Fafter wrongly believing they were
OL,10,Fmigrants, the Pakistan Cricket Board
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FAbout 30 to 40 people congregated at
OL,14,Fthe Marriot Hotel in Cosham,
OL,15,FPortsmouth, on Tuesday evening after
OL,16,Ffalse rumours circulated that a coach
OL,17,Fcarrying migrants had arrived.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
