OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACricketers mistaken for migrants
OL,4,Ahad 'doors knocked on'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSumair Syed, chief operating officer of
OL,7,Fthe Pakistan Cricket Board, said the
OL,8,Fteam reported people had been "knocking
OL,9,Fon their doors" during the incident,
OL,10,Fbut the players "behaved responsibly
OL,11,Fand didn't escalate the situation".
OL,13,FHampshire Police said officers found no
OL,14,Foffences had been committed, and the
OL,15,Fcrowd dispersed by about 21:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
